Package: DOST
Title: Distance-preserving Optimization for Spatial Transcriptomics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mısra", "Taşçı", , "mtasci18@ku.edu.tr", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mehmet", "Gönen", , "mehmetgonen@ku.edu.tr", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: DOST is a distance-preserving optimization based method that clusters spatial transcriptomics (ST) spots into spatial domains. DOST embeds ST spots into a low-dimensional space using a Sammon mapping inspired loss function that jointly preserves gene expression similarity and spatial smoothness.
